ay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/d0aab8f771f1ae77fd0cf2bccd6b5e26.poster.avif?t=1771169571\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/d0aab8f771f1ae77fd0cf2bccd6b5e26.webm?t=1771169571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/d0aab8f771f1ae77fd0cf2bccd6b5e26.mp4?t=1771169571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Total Freedom:</strong> Create tracks from scratch in diverse themes like tropical beaches, messy bedrooms, or high-tech workshops. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Hazards:</strong> Place jumps, swinging obstacles, and custom traps to challenge your rivals. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Logic &amp; Mechanics:</strong> Use advanced tools to animate rotations, movements, and spawning objects for a truly living world. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft Your own animated Vehicles!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/16e8e428f975b41a86257cbd762bf674.poster.avif?t=1771169571\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/16e8e428f975b41a86257cbd762bf674.webm?t=1771169571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/16e8e428f975b41a86257cbd762bf674.mp4?t=1771169571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why settle for a standard car? Choose a base and customize your ride:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><